Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.88,0:00:05.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我第一次碰这把刀的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}First time I touched that blade.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.18,0:00:06.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就知道没人能阻止我\N{\fnArial\fs30}I knew that I wouldn't be stopped.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.41,0:00:08.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一定会杀了Abaddon\N{\fnArial\fs30}And that I would take down Abaddon.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.05,0:00:09.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,或者其它我必须干掉的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}And anything else that I had to.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.57,0:00:11.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很高兴这把初刃给了你力量\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm glad the blade gives you strength.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.31,0:00:12.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,冷静 还是什么的\N{\fnArial\fs30}The calm or whatever.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.43,0:00:13.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我开始觉得\N{\fnArial\fs30}I gotta say I'm starting to think.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.38,0:00:14.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,这把刀还有其他作用\N{\fnArial\fs30}The blade is doing something else, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.44,0:00:17.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,这场天使之间的战争无可避免了 是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}So this war between angels is really gonna happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.73,0:00:19.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,可以避免 如果我能找出合适的外交策略\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not if I can find a diplomatic option.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.41,0:00:22.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道你真的相信这是为了大局着想\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know you truly believe is for the grader good.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.35,0:00:24.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,你对Metatron的误信 会让你再次失望\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your mistaken trust in Metatron will bring you down again.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.90,0:00:27.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,大门都被封印了 谁都进不去\N{\fnArial\fs30}The gates are sealed, no one can get in.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.01,0:00:28.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁跟你说大门了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who said anything about gates.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.48,0:00:30.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,有秘密入口还要大门干吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't need gates when you have a private portal.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.48,0:00:31.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,不会有这种东西存在的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can't have something like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.57,0:00:34.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,可以有 如果那个传送门到处移动\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can if it moves around from place to place.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.48,0:00:36.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,头儿想把它放哪儿就能放哪儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}If it's wherever the boss wants it to be.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.75,0:00:39.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,你体内偷来的荣光还还好使吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}How's that stolen grace inside you working out.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.59,0:00:40.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.32,0:00:41.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不好\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, it's not.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.79,0:00:42.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,Dean\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.54,0:00:43.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,我认识你吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do I know you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.22,0:00:44.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们是老相识了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We go way back.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.37,0:00:49.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,Tessa\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tessa.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.76,0:00:51.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道他们不知道的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know something they don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.39,0:00:52.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,结局\N{\fnArial\fs30}The ending.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.13,0:00:53.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我怎样能成功不重要\N{\fnArial\fs30}How I get there doesn't matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.04,0:00:56.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,只要每个人都做好自己的工作\N{\fnArial\fs30}As long as everybody plays their part.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.42,0:01:08.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要一个脱脂非乳制香草味冰淇林球\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, give me one scoop of the no fat non-dairy vanilla.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.62,0:01:11.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,要四分之一勺无糖的焦糖 和十个\N{\fnArial\fs30}With a quarter teaspoon of the sugar-free caramel and ten.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.38,0:01:12.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是九个 不是十一个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not nine, not eleven.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.09,0:01:13.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,蓝莓\N{\fnArial\fs30}Blueberries.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.29,0:01:14.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,记住了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.38,0:01:15.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.47,0:01:17.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想吃什么 亲爱的\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you want, honey.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.16,0:01:19.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个\N{\fnArial\fs30}That.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.58,0:01:25.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,不好意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.97,0:01:27.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道这不关我的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know this is none of my business.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.82,0:01:29.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,的确不关你的事 走开\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're right it's not, go away.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.08,0:01:31.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,你父母在哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where are your parents.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.79,0:01:33.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没父母\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't have parents.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.76,0:01:34.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是天使\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm an angel.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.05,0:01:36.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 你是个小天使\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, you're a little angel.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.15,0:01:40.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,你坐这儿你妈妈知道吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did your mother know you're sitting here.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.75,0:01:41.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,快吃成糖尿病了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eating diabetes.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.78,0:01:44.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,快跑\N{\fnArial\fs30}You need to run.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.89,0:01:45.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.13,0:01:47.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,快跑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.78,0:02:14.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,反应不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nice reflexes.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.46,0:02:16.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,发型更炫酷\N{\fnArial\fs30}Better hair.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.01,0:02:17.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,你什么情况\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's wrong with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.02,0:02:20.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我差点开枪打到你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I could've shot you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.73,0:02:23.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么不睡觉 我们两小时前才躺下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why aren't you sleeping, we got in like two hours ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.62,0:02:25.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,不累 而且我们有活干\N{\fnArial\fs30}No tired, and we got work to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.73,0:02:27.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,穿上你的舞鞋 王子叫你去舞会呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Put on your dance shoes and let's boogie.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.78,0:02:37.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 什么事\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, what's up.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.55,0:02:39.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我给Cass打了电话\N{\fnArial\fs30}I called Cass.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.63,0:02:40.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,他说密苏里州出了点问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}He said something's going down in Missouri.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.03,0:02:42.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}What kind of something.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.58,0:02:44.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,他说在电话上不方便说\N{\fnArial\fs30}He said he couldn't talk about it on the phone.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.29,0:02:46.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.82,0:02:49.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为他是个怪人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because he is a weird guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.34,0:02:52.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为他又怪又蠢\N{\fnArial\fs30}OK?He's a weird dorky little guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.14,0:02:55.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,但他刚好手下有一个天使军团 哥们儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}But, he happens to have an army of angels behind him, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.25,0:02:56.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,不得不说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Even though we have to say.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.98,0:02:58.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我们想杀Metatron\N{\fnArial\fs30}That if we're gonna take a shot at Metatron.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.44,0:03:00.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,他的军队可能会有用\N{\fnArial\fs30}It might be useful.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.37,0:03:03.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么 你觉得我们需要初刃\N{\fnArial\fs30}What, do you think we need the first blade.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.03,0:03:05.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么不留在这儿呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why we just, leave that here.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.09,0:03:08.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们谈过了 我们决定\N{\fnArial\fs30}We talked about this, and we decided that.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.55,0:03:10.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 这样说不公平\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no fairness.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.67,0:03:12.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是我们决定的 是你\N{\fnArial\fs30}We didn't decide, you did.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.74,0:03:13.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 我决定的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ok I decided.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.68,0:03:16.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个可以杀死任何东西的棍子\N{\fnArial\fs30}That hockey stick that can kill anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.36,0:03:18.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,用起来会很顺手\N{\fnArial\fs30}Might come in handy.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.41,0:03:19.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,你能把我怎样\N{\fnArial\fs30}So sue me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.25,0:03:21.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,这件事我们讨论过多少次了\N{\fnArial\fs30}How many times have we been around this block.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.48,0:03:24.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,使用这么强大的魔法一定是要付出代价的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Magic that powerful comes at a price.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.38,0:03:26.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在我们不知道这个代价是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}And right now we don't know what that price is.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.21,0:03:30.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很好 我简直棒呆了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm fine, I'm fanfriggingtastic.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.20,0:03:31.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很高兴 真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm glad, honestly.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.47,0:03:33.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没说我们得把它埋了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not saying that we bury that thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.06,0:03:36.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是说等到真正用的时候再拿出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm saying we just save it for when we really need it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.60,0:03:38.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,对付Crowley，对付Metatron\N{\fnArial\fs30}Crowley, Metatron.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.75,0:03:39.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,Boss大战\N{\fnArial\fs30}The big boss fights.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.99,0:03:42.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不用一直带着它不是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't have to have it with you all the time, right.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.56,0:03:44.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,把它留下吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean just leave it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.98,0:03:46.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.78,0:03:52.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,没问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}No problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.47,0:03:54.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.30,0:04:10.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,Spears和Aguilera探长 联邦调查局的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Agent Spears and Aguilera, FBI.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.18,0:04:12.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.00,0:04:14.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们的同事说你们会来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your partner said you'll be along.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.75,0:04:17.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.43,0:04:22.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你们赶来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you for coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.36,0:04:24.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,Spears和Aguilera是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Spears and Aguilera.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.59,0:04:26.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我发现你们的化名\N{\fnArial\fs30}I realized that your alias.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.01,0:04:28.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,通常都是流行音乐家的名字\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are usually the names of popular musicians.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.63,0:04:32.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,过来 看看这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come here, take a look at this.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.20,0:04:39.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,看 另外的尸体也是一样的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, the other bodies are the same.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.63,0:04:41.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,烧焦的躯壳\N{\fnArial\fs30}Burnt out husks.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.84,0:04:44.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,这到底是什么 大规模屠杀吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}OK so what is this, some sort of mass smiting.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.12,0:04:45.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也不知道这是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know what this was.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.73,0:04:48.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,从来没见过\N{\fnArial\fs30}Never seen anything like it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.85,0:04:50.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,死了六个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Six humans died here.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.25,0:04:53.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个天使\N{\fnArial\fs30}And one angel.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.63,0:04:57.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,你手下的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}One of yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.99,0:05:00.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,他曾是个好战士\N{\fnArial\fs30}Was a good soldier.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.38,0:05:03.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,这次攻击\N{\fnArial\fs30}This attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.42,0:05:06.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道他想挑起战争\N{\fnArial\fs30}I knew he wanted a war.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.53,0:05:12.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,就算是他也不该做出这么卑鄙的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}But this, this is abhorrent even for him.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.21,0:05:26.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,等一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just a second.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.70,0:05:32.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我等了你一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}I gave you a second.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.96,0:05:36.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,有时你还真是个典型的天使\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are such an angel sometimes.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.09,0:05:37.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想干什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you want.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.41,0:05:39.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,谈谈今晚的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}To talk about tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.38,0:05:42.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们会没事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.19,0:05:45.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,不我们 我们正在失势 Metatron\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, we, we're losing, Metatron.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.09,0:05:48.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟随Castiel的人比我们多\N{\fnArial\fs30}Castiel's followers outnumber us.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.56,0:05:50.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,尽管他们还没闯进我们的领地\N{\fnArial\fs30}And while they haven't gone on our fence.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.37,0:05:51.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,但他们证明了自己有这个能力\N{\fnArial\fs30}They have proven capable.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.95,0:05:53.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们成功阻止了你杀死他\N{\fnArial\fs30}They have stopped you from killing him.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.62,0:05:54.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有我\N{\fnArial\fs30}And me for example.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.82,0:05:57.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说过了那次暗杀计划是个契机\N{\fnArial\fs30}I told you we had our shot with operation Lee Harvey.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.76,0:05:58.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们也把握住了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And we took it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.80,0:06:00.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我下达命令\N{\fnArial\fs30}I gave the orders.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.96,0:06:02.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,没人会伤害你\N{\fnArial\fs30}You weren't to be harmed.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.07,0:06:04.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,你让他们跟踪我\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have me followed.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.57,0:06:06.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,还没说你跑去偷会敌人这事呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you met with the enemy.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.81,0:06:08.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,偷偷摸摸的\N{\fnArial\fs30}In secret.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.05,0:06:12.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,那句关于石头和罪恶的老话是怎么说的\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is that old line about sins and stones.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.31,0:06:15.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,他说了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He spoke.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.54,0:06:17.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我误信了他的谎话\N{\fnArial\fs30}He lied and I listened.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.79,0:06:19.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.51,0:06:21.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我是为天堂效劳\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I serve heaven.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.34,0:06:22.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我为你效力\N{\fnArial\fs30}I serve you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.10,0:06:24.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.26,0:06:26.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,别忘了这一点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't forget it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.97,0:06:35.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也搞不懂这股全民Cass热是怎么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't get this whole Cass love fest, either.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.02,0:06:39.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我给天使们指引回家的路\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm offering our people a way home.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.09,0:06:42.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,但他们还是选择他不选我\N{\fnArial\fs30}And still, still, they're choosing him over me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.11,0:06:45.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是说 当然 他是很帅\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean sure he's cute.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.28,0:06:51.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,Castiel有一种独特的 魅力\N{\fnArial\fs30}And Castiel has this simple charm.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.18,0:06:56.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,就像一个智力低下的小狗\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's like a mentally deficient puppy.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.75,0:06:58.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我也很迷人啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I'm lovable.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.39,0:07:00.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,还很幽默\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm funny.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.13,0:07:05.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还让上帝笑了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I made God laugh.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.89,0:07:06.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,两次\N{\fnArial\fs30}Twice.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.98,0:07:09.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,是你要他带领军队的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are the one who asked him to lead an army.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.78,0:07:12.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我也没想到他擅长这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I didn't think he would be good at it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.24,0:07:14.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,你今晚要和Tyrus见面\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are meeting tonight…Tyrus.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.77,0:07:16.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,剩余的天使军团\N{\fnArial\fs30}He controls the largest.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.27,0:07:18.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,几乎都掌握在他手里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Independent faction of angels left.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.14,0:07:19.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我必须要给他留个好印象\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I have to make a good impression.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.85,0:07:20.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.23,0:07:23.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有计划\N{\fnArial\fs30}I gotta a plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.79,0:07:31.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是我想的那样吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not that, is it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.50,0:07:34.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,闭嘴\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shut up.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.19,0:07:38.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,长官\N{\fnArial\fs30}Commander.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.43,0:07:41.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个场景好诡异\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh this just creepy.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.60,0:07:42.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,Sam Dean\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.94,0:07:44.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是Hannah\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is Hannah.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.80,0:07:46.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,Winchester兄弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Winchesters.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.97,0:07:48.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,久闻大名\N{\fnArial\fs30}I heard so much about you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.35,0:07:50.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,这多亏了Cass 他是我们的粉丝\N{\fnArial\fs30}What can I say, Cass is a fan.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.71,0:07:52.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我马上开示检查这些证据\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll start to examine the evidence.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.51,0:07:56.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,长官 今早Josiah点名时不在\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sir, this morning Josiah wasn't at roll call.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.44,0:07:58.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,点名\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh roll call.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.68,0:08:00.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们还要点名\N{\fnArial\fs30}You hold a roll call.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.62,0:08:02.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们喜欢听我念他们的名字\N{\fnArial\fs30}They like to hear me say their names.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.62,0:08:04.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道有的女人就喜欢这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know a couple of women like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.22,0:08:06.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,Ezra被杀后就没人见过Josiah了\N{\fnArial\fs30}No one's seen Josiah since Ezra was murdered.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.49,0:08:08.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们认为是Josiah杀的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think Josiah is the killer.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.11,0:08:09.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,间谍就是他\N{\fnArial\fs30}And he is a mole.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.31,0:08:10.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,还能是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well who else.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.70,0:08:13.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们到处找过了 但他消失了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We search the grounds but he vanished.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.65,0:08:15.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,他没有翅膀是办不到的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not without wings.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.71,0:08:17.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错他是天使 但现在也只能用人类的方式\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's an angel but he still travels like a human.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.64,0:08:19.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就意味着他只能走路开车\N{\fnArial\fs30}Which means walk, drive.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.98,0:08:21.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,肯定有迹可循\N{\fnArial\fs30}Means he's gonna leave a trail.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.55,0:08:22.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Alright.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.54,0:08:25.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,他的皮囊叫什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What was the vessel's name.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.40,0:08:27.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,Sean Flynn 奥马哈人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sean Flynn from Omaha.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.54,0:08:28.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.23,0:08:36.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,是这个人吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is this the guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.10,0:08:38.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah that's him.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.85,0:08:41.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Alright.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.05,0:08:43.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,看起来他刚刚在科罗拉多\N{\fnArial\fs30}Looks like someone just used his credit card.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.70,0:08:45.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,用信用卡在加油站加了油\N{\fnArial\fs30}At a Gas-n-Sip in Colorado.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.14,0:08:48.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,专业领域就是这样操作的\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's how we do things in the pros.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.52,0:08:50.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,长官\N{\fnArial\fs30}Commander.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.27,0:08:54.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,我发现了些事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have something.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.98,0:08:56.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,这只手机里存了一段录像\N{\fnArial\fs30}This phone's memory chip has a video time-stamped.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.80,0:08:58.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,就在爆炸前拍的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just before explosion.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.47,0:08:59.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,万众期待的时刻到来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And now the moment you've all been waiting for.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.64,0:09:00.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.32,0:09:05.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,为了Castiel\N{\fnArial\fs30}I do this for Castiel.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.88,0:09:18.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,这到底是什么玩意\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell was that.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.45,0:09:19.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.26,0:09:23.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我绝不会指使天使\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't I would never ask an angel.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.54,0:09:25.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,让他们用自杀的方式滥杀无辜\N{\fnArial\fs30}To sacrifice himself to kill innocents.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.36,0:09:27.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,太恶心了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna be sick.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.58,0:09:29.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么这个天使在冰激凌店自爆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why would an angel blow up.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.17,0:09:30.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,同时喊了你的大名\N{\fnArial\fs30}A Colonel Scoop's in your name.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.29,0:09:31.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,这不是他的重点\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's not what he was doing.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.32,0:09:32.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,倒回去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Roll it back.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.54,0:09:40.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,看 那是个天使 她叫Esther\N{\fnArial\fs30}There, that was an angel, Esther.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.86,0:09:44.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,她是Metaron的手下\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's one of Metatron's.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.65,0:09:46.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以 这是买凶杀人\N{\fnArial\fs30}So this is some kind of hit.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.28,0:09:47.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.15,0:09:48.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,别再说你不知道了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop saying you don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.44,0:09:50.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不可以相信我会做这样的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can't think I would allow some things like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.76,0:09:52.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道你想当个好人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know you try to be a good guy, okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.21,0:09:54.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我懂 你努力了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I do.You try.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.01,0:09:55.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你领导的这他妈是个邪教\N{\fnArial\fs30}But what you got here this is a freaking cult.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.99,0:09:56.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,Dean\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.57,0:09:57.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,上次你得势的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}Last time you had this kind of juice.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.34,0:10:00.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,你对人类和天使大开杀戒\N{\fnArial\fs30}You did kill humans and angels and you did nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.92,0:10:02.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么正事儿都没干 还骗的我和Sam团团转\N{\fnArial\fs30}But lie to me and Sam about it the whole damn time.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.90,0:10:03.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们能\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can we, uh.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.40,0:10:05.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们能去别的地儿谈这事儿吗 伙计们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can we take this somewhere else, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.52,0:10:11.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,你能别这么激动吗 Dean\N{\fnArial\fs30}Will you stow the baggage, Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.58,0:10:13.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 我们手头有一个案子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, we've got a case.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.45,0:10:14.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要工作\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's work it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.21,0:10:18.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,Cass 你认识录像里那个天使吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cass, did you know the angel in that video.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.04,0:10:19.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,认识 他叫Orin\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, his name was Oren.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.88,0:10:21.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是个新来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was a new recruit.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.30,0:10:22.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,在社区外围帮工\N{\fnArial\fs30}He worked in community outreach.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.39,0:10:23.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}And what does that mean.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.67,0:10:26.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的一些追随者进驻了社区医院\N{\fnArial\fs30}Some of my troops are stationed at a local hospital.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.63,0:10:28.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,能帮多少帮多少\N{\fnArial\fs30}They help where they can.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.30,0:10:31.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,一些小的医学奇迹 惹不起多大风浪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Minor miracles, it's nothing that would draw attention.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.04,0:10:32.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,那他为什么会出现在那个录像里\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, what was he doing in that video.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.13,0:10:33.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,给了自己一刀\N{\fnArial\fs30}With the stabbing.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.34,0:10:35.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,他胸上刻的天使语记号\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Enochian runes that were carved in his chest.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.07,0:10:39.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,应该是用来聚集荣光的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I…I think that they were meant to focus energy.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.50,0:10:42.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,当他捅了自己一刀 瞬间释放了能量\N{\fnArial\fs30}When he stabbed himself, it unleashed all that power.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.05,0:10:42.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个女孩呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, what about the girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.68,0:10:43.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,她怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What happened to her.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.70,0:10:46.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果她是目标的话 荣光的爆发就指向她\N{\fnArial\fs30}If she was a target, then the blast was focused on her.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.45,0:10:50.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样的话 她只能是被分解了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then more likely than not, she, she was atomized.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.46,0:10:54.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我们现在怎么办\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, what do we do now.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.27,0:10:55.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,你什么都不用做\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, you don't do jack.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.96,0:10:56.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我和Sam去一趟医院\N{\fnArial\fs30}Me and Sam will head to the hospital.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.84,0:10:58.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,看能不能找到\N{\fnArial\fs30}See if we can find somebody.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.06,0:11:00.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,知道这些移动核弹的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who knew this…walking nuke.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.11,0:11:01.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 他们是我的人 我能帮上忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hold on, these are my poeple, I can help.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.48,0:11:03.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,这正是问题所在\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, that's sort of the problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.18,0:11:04.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,只要Charlie一出现\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, the Manson girls aren't gonna give us.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.49,0:11:06.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,Manson就什么都不会说\N{\fnArial\fs30}A straight answer with Charlie in the room.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.64,0:11:08.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以 你也一样不用管\N{\fnArial\fs30}So just hang back.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.21,0:11:09.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我就只能干等了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}So I should just sit here.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.78,0:11:12.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,差不多\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pretty much.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.51,0:11:13.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.90,0:11:15.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你不让我帮忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you don't want my help.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.35,0:11:18.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就去科罗拉多找Josiah\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then I will follow Josiah's trail to Colorado.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.18,0:11:21.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,我必须得做点儿什么 Dean\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have to do something, Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.54,0:11:23.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.79,0:11:26.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是Sam要跟着你\N{\fnArial\fs30}But Sam's coming with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.11,0:11:28.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 什么 - 你不相信我了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What?-Because you don't trust me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.22,0:11:29.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,他去帮你\N{\fnArial\fs30}To help.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.10,0:11:42.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,Abaddon死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Abaddon is dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.84,0:11:45.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,死了一个 站起来一片\N{\fnArial\fs30}And then some.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.15,0:11:47.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 不\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.19,0:11:49.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.85,0:11:52.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,如此不详\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ominous.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.86,0:11:56.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,Dean最近是不是有点儿不对劲\N{\fnArial\fs30}Does Dean seem different to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.91,0:11:58.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.46,0:12:03.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,最近 他就像通了电门一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lately, he seems to be amped up.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.19,0:12:04.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,很烦躁\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, on edge.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.81,0:12:06.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,该隐之印的影响\N{\fnArial\fs30}The effects of the mark.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.94,0:12:08.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,还能因为什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or what else.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.85,0:12:10.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,他的确看起来很生气\N{\fnArial\fs30}He does seem angry.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.25,0:12:11.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是说 他总是有点暴躁\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, he's always a little angry.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.60,0:12:14.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是现在更严重\N{\fnArial\fs30}But now it seems like…more.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.10,0:12:18.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,有一部分的他真的觉得\N{\fnArial\fs30}A part of him actually believes that.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.14,0:12:21.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,是我让那些天使\N{\fnArial\fs30}I ordered those angles to…you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.58,0:12:26.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,Sam 你不这样觉得吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam, you don't.Do you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.06,0:12:31.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 Cass 听我说\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, man.Cass, listen.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.81,0:12:33.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,有奇怪的事情正在发生\N{\fnArial\fs30}We got weird thing going on back there.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.67,0:12:35.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,那些天使 他们盯着你的样子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Those are the angles, the way they stare at you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.45,0:12:40.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,就像盯着什么摇滚明星 或者宗教大能\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's like you, part rock star, part L.Ron.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.68,0:12:43.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们信仰我\N{\fnArial\fs30}They put their faith in me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.22,0:12:44.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,这可能就是问题所在\N{\fnArial\fs30}And maybe that's the problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.90,0:12:46.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,人们一直都在做一些混账的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, people have been doing messed-up crap.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.83,0:12:50.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,以信仰的名义 以上帝的名义\N{\fnArial\fs30}In name of faith, in name of the God.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.23,0:12:52.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,从古至今\N{\fnArial\fs30}Since forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.77,0:12:57.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不是试图扮演上帝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not trying to play God.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.99,0:12:59.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,只是想把我的族人送回家\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just trying to get my people home.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.02,0:13:11.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,好球 太棒了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, well done.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.63,0:13:14.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是个简单的游戏\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's such a simple game.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.21,0:13:17.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们一定会爱上球撞柱的声音\N{\fnArial\fs30}And boy, you gotta love the sound of those pins, huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.02,0:13:21.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,漂亮极了 木头的交响曲\N{\fnArial\fs30}Beautiful, a symphony of wood.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.57,0:13:28.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,你应该听说了我们的提议\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, you've heard our offer.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.23,0:13:30.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,听说了 我在协议上签字\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I signed on the dotted line.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.65,0:13:33.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,我手下所有人 都能回天堂\N{\fnArial\fs30}All my people, they get a ticket upstairs.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.46,0:13:35.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我们不想去呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}What if we don't wanna go.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.89,0:13:36.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,可是那里是家\N{\fnArial\fs30}But it's home.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.87,0:13:38.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,但那儿很无聊\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's boring.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.99,0:13:43.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,天堂没有保龄球这种东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's nothing like this in heaven.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.54,0:13:46.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可以给你建一个保龄球馆\N{\fnArial\fs30}I could whip you off a bowling alley.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.72,0:13:48.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是 那也不一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}But, it wouldn't…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.94,0:13:50.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,闻闻这儿的味道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean just smell that.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.06,0:13:57.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,旧鞋子和酒精\N{\fnArial\fs30}Old shoes and alcoholism.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.33,0:13:58.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,权威\N{\fnArial\fs30}Authenticity.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.60,0:14:02.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就因为打保龄球反抗我吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}So wait, you are turning me down because of bowling.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.30,0:14:05.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也喜欢一个人做事\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I like being an independent operator.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.59,0:14:08.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我听说你快输了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I hear you are losing.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.23,0:14:10.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且我讨厌你的长相\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I hate your face.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.07,0:14:15.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可以换张新脸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I can get a new face.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.66,0:14:17.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,换了脸你也还是你 一个书呆子\N{\fnArial\fs30}You will still be you, a nerd.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.03,0:14:20.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,想要跻身明星学生的行列\N{\fnArial\fs30}Trying to be one of the popular kids.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.50,0:14:25.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 该来点真格的了\N{\fnArial\fs30}OK, time for he hard sell.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.88,0:14:33.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,算了吧 你用刀刺我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please, you knife me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.44,0:14:36.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的人就会全跑到Castiel那边\N{\fnArial\fs30}And all my guys will go running to Castiel.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.14,0:14:44.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,即使是你 也不会干那么傻的事儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Even you are not that stupid.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.80,0:14:48.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过嘛\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll tell you what.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.36,0:14:53.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要是赢了我 我们就有得聊\N{\fnArial\fs30}You out-bowl me, we'll walk.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.93,0:15:01.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我见过他 警官\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah I saw him, officer.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.40,0:15:04.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,给一辆木纹小客车加了油\N{\fnArial\fs30}Filled up some old…woody station wagon.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.01,0:15:06.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,想必你没记下他的车牌号\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't suppose you got the license plate number.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.19,0:15:07.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈哈 没\N{\fnArial\fs30}Haha no.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.78,0:15:10.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,他好像要去蒙大拿州的普雷\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was heading to an address at Pray Montana.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.11,0:15:12.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么知道的\N{\fnArial\fs30}How do you know that.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.75,0:15:14.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,他问我怎么去来着\N{\fnArial\fs30}The guy asked for directions.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.58,0:15:17.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要我写下来吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You want me to write that down.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.85,0:15:18.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,对\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.76,0:15:20.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在就写 谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.57,0:15:22.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我怎么称呼你\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do I call you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.83,0:15:25.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的天使名有十八个音节那么长\N{\fnArial\fs30}My angelic name is eighteen syllables long.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.08,0:15:26.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以你还是叫我明星员工吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's stick with Flagstaff.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.81,0:15:27.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,明白\N{\fnArial\fs30}Copy.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.50,0:15:30.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以你认识这个叫Oren的家伙\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you knew this Oren guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.99,0:15:32.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们一起在医院工作\N{\fnArial\fs30}We worked together at the hospital.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.58,0:15:35.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是个开心果 人又聪明\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was a joy, bright.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.86,0:15:36.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,充满活力\N{\fnArial\fs30}Full of life.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.85,0:15:39.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错 他还有爆炸性的性格\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, he had a real explosive personality.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.23,0:15:40.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,你以为这是个玩笑吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you think this is a joke.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.65,0:15:42.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看到我笑了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you see me laughing.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.77,0:15:47.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,关于他你还知道些什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is there anything else you can tell me about him.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.70,0:15:51.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,比如 为什么他把自己点了\N{\fnArial\fs30}For example, why he lighted his own fuse.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.63,0:15:54.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,无可奉告 我可以走了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, can I go.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.78,0:15:56.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人等着我救命呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have lives to save.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.37,0:15:57.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,彼此彼此\N{\fnArial\fs30}Welcome to club.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.71,0:16:00.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,笑什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Somethin' funny.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.21,0:16:02.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,一点也不好笑 哈哈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not funny, haha.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.93,0:16:05.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,只是 你觉得自己在帮助别人\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you, thinking you help people.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.07,0:16:07.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,这一点很好笑\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's amusing.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.99,0:16:09.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在帮助别人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I help people.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.64,0:16:11.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,动脉阻塞 肿瘤等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Clogged artery here, tumor there.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.98,0:16:13.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我日行一善 你呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}I do good in this world, you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.98,0:16:16.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,你只相信枪能解决所有问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}You believe every problem can be solved with a gun.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.73,0:16:19.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想当英雄 可皮囊下面\N{\fnArial\fs30}You played the hero but underneath the hype.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.27,0:16:20.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就是个杀人犯\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are a killer.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.80,0:16:22.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,手上沾满了鲜血\N{\fnArial\fs30}With ocean's of blood on his hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.98,0:16:25.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,我恨像你这样的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hate man like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.89,0:16:35.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,甜心 再没有第二个像我这样的人了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Honey, there ain't no other men like me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.40,0:16:38.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,别 求你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.13,0:16:40.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oren 他的同党\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oren, friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.66,0:16:45.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,Constantine和Tessa\N{\fnArial\fs30}Constantine and Tessa.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.16,0:16:47.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,Tessa 死神Tessa\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tessa, the Reaper Tessa.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.58,0:16:49.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,你认识她\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know her.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.66,0:16:56.77,Note,0,0,0,0,,（普雷 蒙大拿州）
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.58,0:17:09.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,加油站里那人说的就是这辆车吧 对吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}That looks like the car the guy in gas station talking about, right.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.12,0:17:11.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,说不定Josiah还在附近\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe Josiah is still around.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.23,0:17:15.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,Sam 这地方散发着强大的能量\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam, this place's radiating power.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.26,0:17:18.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很久都没遇见过这种情况了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I never felt anything like this since.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.08,0:17:20.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,自从天堂沦陷\N{\fnArial\fs30}Since heaven.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.01,0:17:21.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们必须进去\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have to get in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.98,0:17:35.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,行了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Alright.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.17,0:17:39.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Step aside.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.56,0:17:42.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,我来搞定\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got this.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.95,0:17:53.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,我搞不定\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't got this.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.26,0:18:06.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,晚上好 Tessa\N{\fnArial\fs30}Howdy Tessa.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.32,0:18:13.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,你今晚不是应该在医院值班吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are supposed to be working at the hospital tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.74,0:18:15.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我去找过你 你不在\N{\fnArial\fs30}But when I stopped by, you were gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.39,0:18:18.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,救护车也不在\N{\fnArial\fs30}So was the ambulance.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.02,0:18:20.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,听听行家的意见吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pro tips.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.78,0:18:22.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,医院的车都装了GPS\N{\fnArial\fs30}They all have GPS.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.24,0:18:23.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,多谢告知\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good to know.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.96,0:18:26.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you are here, why.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.69,0:18:29.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,不会是歌舞剧爱好者吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just love musical theatre.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.45,0:18:30.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只喜欢Fiddler\N{\fnArial\fs30}Only if it's Fiddler.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.07,0:18:33.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们得谈谈\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need to talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.32,0:18:34.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.33,0:18:35.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有个约会\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorta got a date.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.03,0:18:41.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,你去不了了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not happening.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.15,0:18:45.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,另一个在哪儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where's the other one.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.96,0:18:47.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,Constantine在哪儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where's Constantine.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.99,0:18:53.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 祝你下次好运 - 谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Better luck next time - Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.01,0:18:54.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,Metatron\N{\fnArial\fs30}Metatron.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.00,0:18:58.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,为了Castiel\N{\fnArial\fs30}I do this for Castiel.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.80,0:19:09.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我检查了所有门窗\N{\fnArial\fs30}I checked all those windows and doors.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.46,0:19:10.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么都没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}No luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.76,0:19:11.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,你呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}What about you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.47,0:19:12.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,有收获吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You find anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.97,0:19:14.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,有\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think so.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.71,0:19:17.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,天使语\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's Enochian.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.44,0:19:20.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,类似谜语的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}I believe it's some sort of riddle.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.30,0:19:26.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么六害怕七\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why is six afraid of seven.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.40,0:19:30.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,难道是因为七是素数\N{\fnArial\fs30}I assume it's because seven is a prim number.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.20,0:19:32.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道素数总是让人心生敬畏\N{\fnArial\fs30}And prim numbers can be intimidating.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.78,0:19:34.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,是因为七吃了九\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's because seven eight nine.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.97,0:19:40.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,文字游戏\N{\fnArial\fs30}Word play.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.06,0:19:41.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,答案就是钥匙\N{\fnArial\fs30}The answer is the key.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.92,0:19:43.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,就像指环王里的都灵之门\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like the Doors of Durin in the Lord of the Rings.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.84,0:19:44.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,等一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait a second.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.93,0:19:47.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道指环王\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know about the Lord of the Rings.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.86,0:19:51.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,我现在可是流行文化大手\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm very pop culture savvy now.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.76,0:19:58.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗨 他怎么样了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, how is he.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.81,0:20:01.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是Cass\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's Cass.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.94,0:20:03.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,你呢 你怎么样了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What about you, how's it going.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.07,0:20:05.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很好 出了趟门 呼吸了新鲜空气\N{\fnArial\fs30}Great.Went out.Got some air.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.93,0:20:07.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,还碰到了一个老朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}Met an old friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.81,0:20:10.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟Sam打个招呼 Tessa\N{\fnArial\fs30}Say hi to Sam.Tessa.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.14,0:20:12.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,你哥哥是个神经病 Sam\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your brother's a psycho, Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.67,0:20:13.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,住嘴\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.26,0:20:15.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,发生什么事了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's going on.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.65,0:20:16.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,你先说\N{\fnArial\fs30}You first.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.72,0:20:18.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道他是总指挥官的朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know he's the commander's friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.20,0:20:20.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道我们应该装作很喜欢他的样子\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I know we are supposed to pretend that we like him.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.22,0:20:23.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是那个猴子居然拿刀抵着我的脖子\N{\fnArial\fs30}But that ape put a knife to my throat.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.35,0:20:26.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,Tessa\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tessa.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.19,0:20:29.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,你干什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you doing.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.28,0:20:30.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,你来告诉她吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You want to tell her.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.36,0:20:36.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 上帝啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh God.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.75,0:20:39.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有上帝\N{\fnArial\fs30}There is no God.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.28,0:20:40.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,只有Castiel\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's only Castiel.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.33,0:20:41.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 聊天结束\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, and you're done.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.89,0:20:47.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,你伤了她\N{\fnArial\fs30}You wounded her.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.85,0:20:53.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,应该说我刚拆除了炸弹\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I defused.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.70,0:20:55.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,划掉她刻在身上的那个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cut up that Old Testament graffiti.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.50,0:20:56.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,圣经旧约图案\N{\fnArial\fs30}She carved into herself.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.40,0:20:58.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得那应该能解除咒语\N{\fnArial\fs30}I figured that would break the spell.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.04,0:21:01.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在 你要拿她怎么办\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, what will you do to her.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.96,0:21:03.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,猜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.89,0:21:04.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,折磨她\N{\fnArial\fs30}Torture.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.94,0:21:05.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,没创意\N{\fnArial\fs30}Predictable.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.99,0:21:07.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们得确定还有没有其它的自爆者\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need to know if there's other bombers out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.80,0:21:10.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 我不同意\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I won't allow it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.70,0:21:12.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道Tessa的计划\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know what Tessa was planning.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.52,0:21:13.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,的确很恐怖\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was horrible.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.12,0:21:17.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是只有一个人能惩罚她\N{\fnArial\fs30}But there's only one person who can punish her.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.38,0:21:20.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我猜猜 这么高\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me guess.This big.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.26,0:21:21.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,穿着风衣 休闲鞋\N{\fnArial\fs30}Trench coat, sensible shoes.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.77,0:21:23.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,你必须理解\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have to understand that.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.05,0:21:25.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,Castiel是唯一能把我们团结在一起的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Castiel is the only thing holding us together.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.25,0:21:27.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个月前 这里一半的天使\N{\fnArial\fs30}A month ago, half the angels in this place.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.31,0:21:29.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,还在想着除掉另一半的天使\N{\fnArial\fs30}Were trying to kill the other half.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.36,0:21:31.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,Castiel让我们有了追求\N{\fnArial\fs30}Castiel has given us a purpose.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.42,0:21:32.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,但更重要的是\N{\fnArial\fs30}But more than that.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.04,0:21:34.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,他教会我们怎样和平共处\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's given us a way to live in peace.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.10,0:21:36.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们有规则 秩序\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have rules, order.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.26,0:21:39.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你擅自做出决定\N{\fnArial\fs30}If I let you take matters into your own hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.03,0:21:41.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,那他们是不是也可以这么不守规矩\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's to stop one of them from doing the same.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.14,0:21:44.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可以和她先谈谈\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can talk to her.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.34,0:21:46.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,你也应该和她谈谈\N{\fnArial\fs30}You should talk to her.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.74,0:21:49.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是别带刀进去\N{\fnArial\fs30}But leave the blade outside.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.55,0:21:56.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们是在请求还是命令\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you asking or telling.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.62,0:21:58.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,这不是请求\N{\fnArial\fs30}We are not asking.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.75,0:22:23.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,你确定你不想调头回去吗 Cass\N{\fnArial\fs30}You sure you don't want to go back, Cass.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.10,0:22:26.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 如果Tessa真是Dean说的那样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, if Dean's right about Tessa.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.16,0:22:31.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 我想 只是\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I do.I just.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.63,0:22:33.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,给我点儿时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give me a second.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.95,0:22:39.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,只有忏悔者可通过\N{\fnArial\fs30}Only the penitent man shall pass.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.29,0:22:44.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,Cass 等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cass, wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.61,0:23:10.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,圣战奇兵 好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}The last crusade, OK.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.39,0:23:14.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的 我们从简单的问题开始\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, let's start with an easy one.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.78,0:23:16.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在为谁工作\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who are you working for.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.16,0:23:17.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,Castiel\N{\fnArial\fs30}Castiel.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.43,0:23:18.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,骗子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Liar.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.15,0:23:23.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们这样的人 也许永远不会明白\N{\fnArial\fs30}People like you may never understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.95,0:23:26.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,牺牲是必须的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sacrifices have to be made.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.52,0:23:29.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们在追杀坏人的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you go after one of the bad guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.04,0:23:32.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果几个人类爆炸了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And if a few humans get microwaved.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.30,0:23:33.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,也没什么关系 是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}No big deal, right.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.11,0:23:35.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,在大计划中\N{\fnArial\fs30}In the grand scheme.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.11,0:23:37.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们无关紧要\N{\fnArial\fs30}They don't matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.12,0:23:39.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,Tessa 你大错特错了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, Tessa, you're so wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.42,0:23:43.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,当Castiel来找我的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}When Castiel came to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.53,0:23:45.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,他交待了我的使命\N{\fnArial\fs30}He told me what I had to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.47,0:23:48.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,他说我被选中的原因是我很坚强\N{\fnArial\fs30}He said I was chosen because I was strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.91,0:23:54.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,其他的人 无法应付这些事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Others, they couldn't handle this.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.09,0:23:57.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们都太软弱\N{\fnArial\fs30}They are too weak.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.52,0:24:06.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,冷静点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Settle down.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.75,0:24:10.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,你觉得她说的是实话吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you think she's telling the truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.03,0:24:13.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,她认为她说的是实话\N{\fnArial\fs30}She thinks she is.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.34,0:24:21.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,Sam 我们找到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam, we found it.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.51,0:24:22.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.34,0:24:24.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,通向天堂的门\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's the door to heaven.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.03,0:24:25.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,真的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Seriously.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.32,0:24:27.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What else.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.86,0:24:30.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,能让Metatron这样千方百计避人耳目\N{\fnArial\fs30}Would Metatron go to such great length to protect.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.54,0:24:31.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我能听见\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can hear it.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:31.20,0:24:33.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,它对我的呼唤 Sam\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's calling me, Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.80,0:24:35.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我们控制了这扇门\N{\fnArial\fs30}If we control this door.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:35.82,0:24:37.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们就能向Metatron宣战\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can take the fight to Metatron.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:39.86,0:24:41.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许我们都用不着打仗了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We might not even need the fight at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:42.43,0:24:43.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,Cass 等一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cass, wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:59.48,0:25:00.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么情况\N{\fnArial\fs30}The hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:13.26,0:25:16.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,欢迎来到你的私人天堂 Castiel\N{\fnArial\fs30}Welcome to your personal heaven, Castiel.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:16.75,0:25:18.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,祝你能找到真的天堂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good luck finding the real one.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:18.42,0:25:19.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:20.01,0:25:20.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:30.60,0:25:33.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,是Josiah 他身上有圣油的味道\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's Josiah, he reeks of holy oil.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:37.60,0:25:38.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:38.92,0:25:40.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,看起来他一个人偷溜回家了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Looks like he got Home Alone-ed.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:44.45,0:25:47.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,这么说 一切都是个谎言\N{\fnArial\fs30}So all this, it's a lie.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:49.35,0:25:52.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,本应在这里的 传送门\N{\fnArial\fs30}Supposed to be here…gate.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:53.52,0:25:57.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,他告诉我 在Ezra的事之后 他告诉我\N{\fnArial\fs30}He told me, after Ezra, he told me.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:58.28,0:25:59.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,说我应该追随他\N{\fnArial\fs30}That I should come to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:01.20,0:26:04.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,Metatron告诉我 我能回家\N{\fnArial\fs30}Metatron told me that I could go home.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:05.78,0:26:07.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只是想回家而已\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just want to go home.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:08.62,0:26:10.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 来 让我 - 不\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Here, let me - No.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:11.62,0:26:12.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,与其被你救活\N{\fnArial\fs30}I would rather die.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:12.65,0:26:15.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还不如这样死去 Castiel\N{\fnArial\fs30}Than owe my life to you Castiel.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:16.67,0:26:19.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,你总是那么的高尚\N{\fnArial\fs30}You play at being noble.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:19.98,0:26:22.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,看起来跟我们一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Play at you being one of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:24.21,0:26:26.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,但当我看着你的眼睛\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I look into your eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:27.20,0:26:30.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,回望着我的不是一个天使\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't see an angel staring back at me.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:46.64,0:26:47.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的朋友呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where's your friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:48.59,0:26:49.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在只有你和我了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just you and me now.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:51.22,0:26:54.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,谈谈我们两个吧 毕竟我们还有过一段历史呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's talk about us, I mean we've got history, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:54.59,0:26:55.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:56.00,0:26:58.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我记得我们美好的邂逅\N{\fnArial\fs30}I still remember our meet-cute.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:58.81,0:26:59.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,当时你快死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're dying.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:00.59,0:27:01.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,美好时光啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good times.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:02.98,0:27:03.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here's a deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:04.34,0:27:06.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我喜欢你 Tess 你要明白\N{\fnArial\fs30}I like you, Tess, okay, for an angel.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:07.52,0:27:09.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是你到底为什么会参与进来\N{\fnArial\fs30}But tell me why you are doing this.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:09.52,0:27:10.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,Castiel\N{\fnArial\fs30}Castiel.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:10.78,0:27:13.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,别管什么Cass 你为什么这么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}Forget Cass, why are you doing this.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:14.24,0:27:16.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,你究竟为什么舍得放弃自己的生命\N{\fnArial\fs30}What would make a person wanna pop their top, huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:17.01,0:27:18.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也有过不好的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, look I have been in a bad shape.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:18.77,0:27:21.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是我从来没堕落至此\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I have never been that damn low.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:24.45,0:27:26.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,大概是我忍受不了那些哀嚎了吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I guess I just can't take the screaming.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:31.77,0:27:32.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁的哀嚎\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who's screaming.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:34.86,0:27:35.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,所有人的\N{\fnArial\fs30}All of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:36.55,0:27:37.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,那些走失的灵魂\N{\fnArial\fs30}The lost souls.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:38.97,0:27:40.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,本来可以安眠于\N{\fnArial\fs30}That ones can't get into heaven.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:40.59,0:27:42.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,天堂的灵魂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now that it's been boarded up.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:43.42,0:27:44.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我能听到他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hear them.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:45.95,0:27:48.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们是那么的困惑\N{\fnArial\fs30}They are so confused.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:49.44,0:27:51.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,如此的痛苦\N{\fnArial\fs30}They are in so much pain.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:53.11,0:27:54.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想做的只不过是帮帮他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}All I wanna do is help them.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:55.22,0:27:57.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是我的工作 我的职责\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's what I do, it's my job.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:59.80,0:28:01.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我现在无能为力\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:02.21,0:28:03.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我受尽折磨\N{\fnArial\fs30}So I suffered.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:04.85,0:28:10.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,直到死亡 归为虚无\N{\fnArial\fs30}Until death, nothingness.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:13.79,0:28:15.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,突然间 死亡也不是那么糟了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Suddenly it didn't seem so bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:17.71,0:28:19.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,看起来很平静\N{\fnArial\fs30}It seemed quiet.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:19.77,0:28:21.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你为什么不直接\N{\fnArial\fs30}So why don't you just jam an angel blade.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:21.25,0:28:22.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,用匕首了断自己\N{\fnArial\fs30}In your throat and call it a day.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:24.53,0:28:25.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想过\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:26.80,0:28:28.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是我太弱了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I was too weak.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:29.42,0:28:31.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,直到Castiel给了我一个可以去死的理由\N{\fnArial\fs30}Till Castiel gave me a reason to die.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:31.94,0:28:32.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:33.25,0:28:35.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,听起来不是我认识的那个Cass\N{\fnArial\fs30}He doesn't sound like the Cass I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:37.23,0:28:38.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是他就是 不是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}But doesn't it though.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:39.47,0:28:40.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,你认识的那个Cass\N{\fnArial\fs30}And the Cass you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:40.25,0:28:43.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,会瞒着你私自组建一个天使大军吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Would he raise an army of angels without telling you.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:45.73,0:28:47.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个Cass这么做了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cause this Cass did.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:49.89,0:28:51.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我来告诉你个秘密吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll tell you a secret.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:53.29,0:28:54.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,外面还有更多人\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's more out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:55.80,0:28:56.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,像我一样的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like me.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:58.05,0:28:59.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,数不胜数\N{\fnArial\fs30}So many more.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:59.20,0:29:00.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有名字吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got names.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:02.73,0:29:04.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,剧透可不好哦\N{\fnArial\fs30}That would ruin all the fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:04.77,0:29:05.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:06.49,0:29:07.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.See.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:12.48,0:29:13.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,好戏才刚刚开始\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fun just getting started.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:14.02,0:29:15.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,Dean 你做了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean, what have you done.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:15.35,0:29:16.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我必须做的\N{\fnArial\fs30}What I had to.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:18.60,0:29:19.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,彼此彼此\N{\fnArial\fs30}Welcome to the club.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:25.20,0:29:26.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:01.12,0:30:02.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,他抵抗了很久\N{\fnArial\fs30}He put up a fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:04.42,0:30:05.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get out.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:08.42,0:30:10.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们真该瞧瞧被我打趴下的那10个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}You should have seen the other 10 guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:10.21,0:30:11.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们说你杀了Tessa\N{\fnArial\fs30}They said you killed Tessa.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:12.01,0:30:15.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,不算是 她自己捅了自己一刀\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not so much, she knifed herself.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:15.38,0:30:16.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,是吗 那她为什么要自杀 Dean\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah?Why would she do that, Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:16.95,0:30:18.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也不知道 Sam\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know, Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:18.72,0:30:19.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,她当时一直在胡言乱语\N{\fnArial\fs30}She was saying all kinds of crap.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:19.89,0:30:21.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以你就把初刃拿出来了是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}So that's why you brought up the first blade.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:24.26,0:30:25.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们告诉你了对吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}They told you about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:25.95,0:30:27.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们说好了的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We had a deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:27.19,0:30:28.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道 但那个约定蠢透了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well.It was a stupid deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:28.36,0:30:29.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Really.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:29.39,0:30:32.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你遵守约定 Tessa就不会死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cause if you stuck to it, Tessa will still be alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:32.24,0:30:33.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有她 我们就什么胜算也没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Without her, we ain't get jack.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:33.68,0:30:34.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,你以为我不知道这些吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think I don't know that.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:34.63,0:30:35.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,你以为我愿意看到这些事情发生吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think I wanted that happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:35.98,0:30:37.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道 Dean 你愿意吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know, Dean, did you.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:37.14,0:30:39.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 够了 都停下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Alright, that's enough, stop it.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:40.03,0:30:42.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,长官 抱歉 但是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Commander, I'm sorry, but.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:43.50,0:30:45.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,有电话找你\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have a call.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:45.57,0:30:47.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,Metatron打来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}From Metatron.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:56.91,0:30:58.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,Castiel\N{\fnArial\fs30}Castiel.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:58.57,0:31:00.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,见到我你一定不太开心吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bet you not happy to see me.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:00.60,0:31:02.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人见到你会开心吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is anyone, ever.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:02.68,0:31:04.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,Dean 你这点滑头都是从80年代\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean, always with the.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:04.71,0:31:08.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,B级动作片里学来的吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}B-grade '80s-action-movie wit.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:08.56,0:31:10.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想干什么 Metatron\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you want, Metatron.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:10.43,0:31:14.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,只是通知混蛋Castiel一声 我还活着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just to tell Asstiel there that I'm still alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:14.06,0:31:15.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,他送来的那个自爆者 任务失败了\N{\fnArial\fs30}His bomber, failed.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:15.85,0:31:17.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么自爆者\N{\fnArial\fs30}My bomber.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:17.14,0:31:20.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是那个疯狂的家伙 拿着长刀 嘭地一声\N{\fnArial\fs30}The crazy guy, big knife, caploo-y.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:20.52,0:31:22.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我活地好好的 多谢关心\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm fine, thanks for asking.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:22.74,0:31:24.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是Gadreel受伤了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But Gadreel is wounded.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:24.30,0:31:27.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有Tyrus\N{\fnArial\fs30}And Tyrus.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:27.29,0:31:28.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,永远安息了\N{\fnArial\fs30}R.I.P.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:28.67,0:31:31.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有 他那些追随者可不是你的死忠粉丝\N{\fnArial\fs30}His followers are not your biggest fans, by the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:31.19,0:31:32.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们都转投于我了\N{\fnArial\fs30}They've all come over to my team.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:32.66,0:31:35.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没有派任何人去杀你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't send anyone to kill you.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:35.00,0:31:37.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托 别骗人了 Castiel\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, stop lying, Castiel.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:37.33,0:31:39.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,你也敢跟我提骗人两个字\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who are you to lecture me on lying.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:39.56,0:31:42.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的诡计多端 导致了天使们的坠落\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your deception, let to the fall.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:42.62,0:31:45.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只是做了我该做的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I did what I had to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:45.53,0:31:49.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一直在做我必须做的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I always done what I have to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:49.09,0:31:52.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,为了上帝 还有天使们\N{\fnArial\fs30}For God, and for the angels.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:52.08,0:31:54.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,那当然 你是长着大胡子的修女特蕾莎\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sure, your mother Teresa with neck beard.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:54.60,0:31:57.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的所作所为不能用好坏来衡量\N{\fnArial\fs30}What I did was neither good or bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:57.08,0:31:58.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我做的都是必须做的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was necessary.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:58.68,0:32:02.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,一点小挫折会让我们更加强大\N{\fnArial\fs30}A small hardship to make us all stronger.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:02.40,0:32:03.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,也会让我们重新团结起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}To make us a family again.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:03.96,0:32:06.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,除了你让Gadreel杀掉的那些天使之外\N{\fnArial\fs30}Except for the angels you had Gadreel killed.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:07.42,0:32:09.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:10.22,0:32:13.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一开始可能是有点过于激动了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe I got a little carried away, at first.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:13.48,0:32:15.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是如今不会再这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}But those days are over.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:15.47,0:32:18.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,濒死体验会让你有全新的价值观\N{\fnArial\fs30}And near death experience makes you reevaluate.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:18.63,0:32:21.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以仅此一次\N{\fnArial\fs30}So one time only.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:21.55,0:32:23.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我发出特赦令\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm offering amnesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:23.95,0:32:28.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,所有天使 无论曾犯下什么罪孽\N{\fnArial\fs30}Every angel, no matter what their sin.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:28.08,0:32:30.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,都可以投靠我 然后回到天堂\N{\fnArial\fs30}May join me and return to heaven.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:32.29,0:32:34.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会成为他们的上帝\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will be their God.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:34.48,0:32:37.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们是我的天堂的新主人\N{\fnArial\fs30}And they will be my heavenly host.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:37.98,0:32:40.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们为什么要跟随你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why would we follow you.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:41.77,0:32:44.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,看看周围吧 你们都见识过地球了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look around, you've seen earth.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:44.69,0:32:46.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,也都尝过了自由的滋味\N{\fnArial\fs30}You had a taste of free will.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:46.81,0:32:49.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我得问问 你真的喜欢自由吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}I gotta ask you, do you like it.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:49.23,0:32:53.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们成群结队的跟随Castiel\N{\fnArial\fs30}The way you flocked off to follow Castiel tells me.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:53.09,0:32:55.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,说明你们需要一个首领\N{\fnArial\fs30}You need to follow someone.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:55.49,0:32:56.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是根植在你们基因中的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's in your DNA.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:56.93,0:33:01.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是Cass 他并不像你们想象中的那样\N{\fnArial\fs30}But Cass, he is not what you think he is.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:01.42,0:33:05.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,他让天使们白白送死\N{\fnArial\fs30}He sends angels out to die.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:06.56,0:33:07.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,你告诉他们关于\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have you told them.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:07.45,0:33:10.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,你偷来的荣光了吗 Castiel\N{\fnArial\fs30}About your stolen grace, Castiel.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:11.69,0:33:13.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的荣光是如何正在消逝\N{\fnArial\fs30}How it's fading away.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:14.23,0:33:17.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有当它消耗殆尽 你也会一同毁灭\N{\fnArial\fs30}And when it burns out so are you.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:19.27,0:33:23.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,看来没有了\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, no then.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:25.58,0:33:29.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不是最完美的 但我是你们的最佳人选\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not the best, but I'm the best you've got.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:29.72,0:33:32.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们想要留在Castiel身边 可以\N{\fnArial\fs30}You wanna stay with Castiel, fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:32.35,0:33:34.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是他不过是在玩弄你们\N{\fnArial\fs30}But he is playing you.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:34.21,0:33:35.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为一旦末日来临\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because in the end of the day.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:35.71,0:33:37.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,他唯一在意的\N{\fnArial\fs30}The only thing he cares about.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:37.07,0:33:39.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,只有他自己和那边的男孩二人组\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is himself and the Hardy Boys there.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:41.59,0:33:43.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,该你们做出抉择了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've got a choice to make.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:43.53,0:33:45.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,明智点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Make the right one.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:52.72,0:33:53.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,他在撒谎\N{\fnArial\fs30}He is lying.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:53.66,0:33:55.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,荣光是怎么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}About the grace.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:58.48,0:34:00.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,一言难尽\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's complicated.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:00.38,0:34:02.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以他说的是真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}So he wasn't lying.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:02.25,0:34:04.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,除了荣光他说的都是假的\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was about everything else.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:13.12,0:34:14.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,你相信我 对吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You believe me, don't you.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:14.66,0:34:17.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想要相信你 但是\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want to believe you, but I.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:21.53,0:34:22.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,证明给我们看\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need proof.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:22.62,0:34:24.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,说吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Name it.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:24.03,0:34:24.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,惩罚他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Punish him.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:24.93,0:34:26.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:26.11,0:34:29.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,他杀了Tessa 破了我们的规矩\N{\fnArial\fs30}He murdered Tessa, he broke our rules.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:29.22,0:34:30.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们都可以去死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You all can go to hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:31.12,0:34:32.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,Dean\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:33.06,0:34:34.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait a second.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:35.01,0:34:38.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,你给我们命令 Castiel\N{\fnArial\fs30}You give us order, Castiel.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:38.05,0:34:40.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,而我们也将信任交予你\N{\fnArial\fs30}And we gave you our trust.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:41.98,0:34:44.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要因为一个人而不顾大局\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't lose it over one man.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:48.62,0:34:50.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是正义\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is justice.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:14.99,0:35:17.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 我不能\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:26.32,0:35:28.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,再见 Castiel\N{\fnArial\fs30}Goodbye, Castiel.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:54.66,0:35:55.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说的没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:56.81,0:35:58.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,只有我们才是正道\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's no other side.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:01.05,0:36:02.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,欢迎加入\N{\fnArial\fs30}Welcome aboard.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:08.32,0:36:11.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,Castiel的第一批追随者前来报道了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The first of Castiel's flock has come around.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:11.61,0:36:13.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,剩下的人也会随之而来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}The rest will follow.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:13.61,0:36:17.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,你应该告诉我 那个特别小组是干什么的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You should've told me what our…elite unit was for.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:17.97,0:36:19.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么 这又不关你的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why, it was none of your business.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:19.42,0:36:20.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,Tessa\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tessa.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:20.78,0:36:22.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,Constantine\N{\fnArial\fs30}Constantine.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:22.71,0:36:24.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,是我召集了他们 而你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I recruited them and you.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:25.71,0:36:28.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,你用花言巧语引诱他们去自毁\N{\fnArial\fs30}You brainwashed them into blowing themselves up.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:29.58,0:36:30.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}So.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:31.50,0:36:33.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,这都是编剧的小伎俩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well that's an old writer's trick.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:34.32,0:36:35.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,制造点儿小起伏什么的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Flipping the script.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:36.97,0:36:41.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,首先 你要制造一个坚不可摧的敌人形象\N{\fnArial\fs30}You start by building a seemingly unbeatable enemy.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:41.64,0:36:43.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,比如说 死星\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like the Death Star.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:43.38,0:36:44.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,或者\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:44.94,0:36:48.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个敌对天使 掌握着一个军队\N{\fnArial\fs30}A rival angel with a bigger…army.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:48.75,0:36:50.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样的话 我看起来就略弱一筹\N{\fnArial\fs30}That way I look like the underdog.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:50.67,0:36:51.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是紧接着\N{\fnArial\fs30}But then.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:51.60,0:36:52.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 不\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:53.21,0:36:55.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,竞争目的变得不那么单纯了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The competition gets greedy.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:56.07,0:36:58.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,他把所有人逼得太紧了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He starts pushing things too much.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:59.72,0:37:02.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然 这要多多感谢我们潜伏着的自爆者们\N{\fnArial\fs30}With the help of my combustible double agent.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:03.37,0:37:06.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,在一番使人警醒的对话后\N{\fnArial\fs30}And then after an arousing speech.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:06.86,0:37:09.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,他最大的弱点显露了出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}His true weakness is revealed.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:10.78,0:37:13.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,他爱上了 人类\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's in love…with humanity.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:14.76,0:37:15.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在\N{\fnArial\fs30}And now.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:20.57,0:37:21.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我无人可挡\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm inevitable.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:23.96,0:37:25.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,那Josiah呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}What about Josiah.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:27.54,0:37:29.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,他可能靠不住\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was a lose end.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:30.05,0:37:32.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我告诉他传送门的位置了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I told him where the gate was.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:33.63,0:37:34.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,至少在我们转移地点之前\N{\fnArial\fs30}Before we moved it.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:36.34,0:37:39.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,真希望Cass能不小心踩进我设下的陷阱\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just wish that Cass has walked in one of those traps.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:41.46,0:37:43.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,不论如何 重点是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anyway, the point is.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:44.11,0:37:46.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,当其他人都醉心于西洋棋的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}While everyone else is playing checkers.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:47.42,0:37:49.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在玩儿大富翁\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm playing monopoly.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:49.92,0:37:53.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且我总能在大西洋城建旅馆\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I always build up a hotel on board walk.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:54.78,0:37:56.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,赢家只能是我\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I always win.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:24.13,0:38:25.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以 Dean\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:26.22,0:38:27.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们到底要不要谈一谈\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're gonna talk about this or what.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:28.24,0:38:29.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,谈什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}About what.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:29.62,0:38:30.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 我撒谎了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I lied.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:30.88,0:38:32.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是你一直表现得像巨婴一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you're being an infant.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:34.51,0:38:36.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,就算是你 这么道歉也很糟糕\N{\fnArial\fs30}Even for you, that apology sucks.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:36.20,0:38:37.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,我这不是道歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not apologizing.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:37.98,0:38:39.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只是在告诉你实情\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm telling you how it's gonna be.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:40.25,0:38:40.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,Dean\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:41.32,0:38:43.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,初刃是唯一能杀死Metatron的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Blade is the only thing that can kill Metatron.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:43.03,0:38:44.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,而我是唯一可以使用初刃的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I'm the only one who can use it.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:46.12,0:38:49.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,从现在开始 有我说了算 明白\N{\fnArial\fs30}So from here on, I'm calling the shots, capish.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:51.05,0:38:53.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,在我一刀捅进那个混蛋的心脏之前\N{\fnArial\fs30}Until I jam that Blade to that douchbag's heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:53.95,0:38:55.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不是一队的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're not a team.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:55.66,0:38:57.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,这事儿我一人说了算\N{\fnArial\fs30}And this is a dictatorship.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:57.71,0:38:58.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不需要听你的意见\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you don't have to like it.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:58.64,0:38:59.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,事实就是这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}But that's how it's gonna be.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:07.67,0:39:08.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么样\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, batteries.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:12.73,0:39:14.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我很好 - 不 你一点儿都不好\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'm fine - No, you're not.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:15.33,0:39:16.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的荣光还能坚持多长时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}How long do you get.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:17.33,0:39:19.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,足够毁掉Metatron了 我希望\N{\fnArial\fs30}Long enough to destroy Metatron, I hope.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:22.12,0:39:23.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我没有军队了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not without an army.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:24.51,0:39:25.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还有我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}You still got us.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:30.38,0:39:30.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,Dean\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:33.25,0:39:34.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,那些自爆者\N{\fnArial\fs30}Those bombers.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:35.39,0:39:36.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不会真的以为是我\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't really think that I.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:36.86,0:39:39.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,你刚刚为了我放弃了整个军队\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guess you just gave up an entire army for one guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:40.53,0:39:43.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,不可能是你 你不会叫那些人去送死的\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, there's no way that you blow those people away.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:49.46,0:39:51.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真的相信仅凭我们三人就能成功\N{\fnArial\fs30}You really believe we three will be enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:54.20,0:39:55.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,事情不向来如此吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}It always have been.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:02.19,0:40:02.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,大家\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:04.86,0:40:06.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不是来打架的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not here to fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:08.90,0:40:10.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我仔细想了想你说的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought about what you said.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:11.37,0:40:12.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是对的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:12.55,0:40:13.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,Metatron他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Metatron he's.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:16.34,0:40:17.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,有些事必须有人来做\N{\fnArial\fs30}Something needs to be done.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:18.51,0:40:20.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们为什么要相信你\N{\fnArial\fs30}And we should trust you why.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:20.59,0:40:22.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为我能把他交给你们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because I can give him to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:22.76,0:40:24.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道Metatron在哪儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know where Metatron is.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:24.91,0:40:25.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:28.48,0:40:29.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道那些自爆者\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know the bombers, they.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:31.40,0:40:33.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们是他的手下 不是你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}They were his agents, not yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:39.13,0:40:41.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们不信任我 这我可以理解\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't trust me, fine, I understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:41.04,0:40:44.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,我 我犯过错\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've…made mistakes.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:46.33,0:40:47.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,但难道你没有吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}But haven't you.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:48.34,0:40:49.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们都没有错吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Haven't we all.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:52.94,0:40:54.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,至少给我一个机会\N{\fnArial\fs30}At least give me a chance.
